{"v":4,"catch":"刺激的俯衝轟炸！","desc":"《Metal Hawk》是 NAMCO（“Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.”）於 1988 年發行的一款射擊遊戲。\n通過操作您的飛機同時改變其高度並在時限內摧毀雷達上顯示的目標來賺取積分。\n在高空搜索敵人，如果發現敵人或敵人基地，則下降到射程並摧毀它們。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-12-22","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/291d51d42016ed6da98af16dcbe11698c5c35b14382665560d57716df245c912.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bd3c6e41718eb5a921683b40d9d231b1536759bfc3a9490eb83ad071cf4b3bcc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8f08cf900c043da0aa4d646bd69075de0c86020a1a0f9311d0628bb4d1249aec.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/786e04188879566dd217af5af041c5e4f4402e26dcdd2f0567131c82f8a8ecaf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/64245412c0d7b5d6b13ee0e5a28ba2b8224523788ee36a08d5110402deb0441f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/69c92585bda4ff2f2e92a8d0f450699dd134c768a0bbe9eabfa7a9dfc8cdd030.jpg"],"titleId":"010047e019790000","dlc":[]}